      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are asking for information on cultural communication styles, which is a legitimate topic for training. However, even when framed as \"cultural differences,\" any attempt to categorize specific behavioral traits by ethnicity is inherently a form of stereotyping. It's far more effective to train officers on universal principles of de-escalation and active listening rather than trying to map complex cultural nuances onto broad ethnic groups. Focus on individual interaction, not group generalizations.",
